      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "i = 0\n\nwhile (cur != null)  // as long as our current pointer is not null\n    // found index!\n    if (i == index)\n        return cur.value\n    i++\n    cur = cur.next\n\n// we could not find the index\nreturn -1",
