      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "if (prev.next != null) // we are not at the end\n\n    // what if we were removing the tail?\n    if (prev.next = tail)\n        tail = prev\n    \n    prev.next = prev.next.next // skip over node to delete\n",
